script 10 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"대단해, 곤타!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이제 원할 때마다\n옥스 파이어로 변신할\n수 있게 됐네!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Bud
	"뭐, 가끔은\n되긴 해."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"하지만 보통은 실패해."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"그, 그렇구나..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	bgmPlay
		bgm = 33
		fadeTime = 1
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Bud
	"나도 내 방식대로\n최선을 다하고 있어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"난 늘 네가 나쁜 상황을\n해결해 주기만 기다리잖아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그래서 항상 미안한 마음이\n들어..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"난 언제나 덩치만 큰\n한심한 낙오자였어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"곤타..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 11 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Bud
	"하지만 이제는...\n내 위저드는 옥스고,\n전파 변환도 할 수 있어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"아직 배울 게 많지만\n마음을 다하면\n해낼 수 있어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"머지않아..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"전파 변환도 쉽게\n해내고 네 곁에서 함께\n싸울 수 있게 될 거야!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"기대할게, 곤타!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Bud
	"아이고...\n전파 변환을 했더니\n엄청 배고프네!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"바비큐로 돌아가자!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Geo
	"좋아!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
